      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-02-22T02:14:26.526Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that was the question from a previous episode. Was the red hat figure Grimm to whom that quote was attributed?</p>\n<p>I didn’t know if the Discord had heard something the rest of us hadn’t, but I thought I heard Grimm mentioned again here as though C&amp;A had discussed them before.</p>\n<p>My only avenue for updates is <em>The Letters Page</em> and Kickstarter/Backerkit since I’m not a Patreon backer and haven’t bought into SCRPG materials yet. I remember being utterly confused at the Neighborhood Watch episode with the Shenanigans too.</p>\n<p>This could just be another instance of time-will-tell-who-can-say. If someone finds the timestamp of the Grimm mention, could you point it out for me please? Thanks in advance.</p>",
